Place reviewed, reusable user-authored skills in NAME/SKILL.md here.
codex/setup.sh links each individual directory into ~/.codex/skills/NAME,
then links ~/.agents/skills/NAME to that path for discovery.
The skills directories themselves stay real so Codex can manage installed skills.
Correct links are retained; conflicts prompt for backup or skip. A skipped
Codex skill destination is not exposed at the discovery path.
Do not copy bundled skills, plugin caches, project instructions, or secrets.
